   "what_happened": "The launcher was first started at 07:40:27 on 14 November 2026 (local time, UTC+7), when the accelerator was free. Neither server came up: the second host does not allow files in its temporary directory to be executed, and the serving library compiles a module there when it starts and could not load it. The launcher ended at 07:46:22. It had sent no call: no check call and no call of the sample. It was started again, unchanged, at 08:16:54 with the environment variable TMPDIR of the calling shell set to a directory on the home file system. The prompts, the parser, the sample, the serving flags and the launcher are those of the commit of the plan.",
